    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053"
    },
    {
        "text": "Boss, you were right. We lost them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "Those rebels... Crafty little sand beasts, the lot of them. Just five seconds, and it's like they all burrowed into the sand without a trace.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_393_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure enough, and that's why we shouldn't waste our energy on them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Guard your position well, until they poke their heads out of their holes again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure. You're the boss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like you found yourself a bunch of loyal subordinates, 'Boss.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_393_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "They think it'll pay dividends. It's good for morale.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "They trust you too. I can tell. It's far more than what a mercenary should afford another mercenary.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_393_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just goes to show how effective Manfred's plan is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "You think real highly of him. I almost forgot. You two are practically brothers from another mother these days, right? Just look at the mansion he gave you. The den alone is larger than your old backyard.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_393_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was a count's estate. I killed its previous owner.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't tell me that's weighing on your conscience.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_393_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "He was having afternoon tea at the time... His wife and their three children were sitting right in front of him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure, this is nothing like the kind of work we used to take, but you're the one who agreed to the job. Nothing to mourn when our consciences died so long ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_393_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then let's not ask these questions. Whatever it is you want to know, just take a look for yourself. Not like you don't know already.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is you being under a lot of stress supposed to somehow make me feel better?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whatever. Let's talk about something else. It's not the time for us to find comfort in each other. I'm here because I have some advice for you\u2014Pay attention to what's under your feet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_393_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You mean...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mercenaries aren't all that trustworthy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you don't pay attention to the shadows when you walk, your efforts might just be all for naught.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_393_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that all you came here for?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, that's not all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "What I really wanted to say is\u2014After drifting around for so long, she's on the road.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
