    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$nervous_intro",
        "key": "$nervous_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_233_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are our men in position?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mandragora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, all at that place per the Sarkaz's orders.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_233_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't be daft. I'm not talking about what the Sarkaz want us to do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mandragora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_233_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Captain, are we really going to start this operation tonight? Are you sure we won't...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_233_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You trying to ask if we'll fall into Manfred's trap?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mandragora"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you think I'm so stupid that I can't tell what he's trying to do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mandragora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_233_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No, of course not... I wouldn't dare to...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_233_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "He's trying to test me, and I'll let him test me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mandragora"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our men are his to order around... but he doesn't know how many of us there are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mandragora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_233_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So, we still have to be the Sarkaz's gatekeepers, then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_233_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Shut up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mandragora"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hate putting it that way. It makes it sound as though we're the Sarkaz's... the Sarkaz's...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mandragora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_233_1#8",
        "name2": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Gah, whatever. We just have to bear with it today. Once we're done with this last thing, we'll leave Londinium straight away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mandragora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_233_1#8",
        "name2": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "W-Will we really? That's wonderful news!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ever since I was a kid... I... I've always hated Londinium. My parents both came to this place and never went back...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "This city eats people!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_233_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Right, I don't like it either. Have you ever seen another city like this? So many plates, so many tall towers, and so many sewers?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mandragora"
    },
    {
        "text": "Every time I smell that stench... The smell of grease on the nobles' dining tables, it makes me want to puke.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mandragora"
    },
    {
        "text": "And now we can finally leave.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mandragora"
    },
    {
        "text": "Get the word out, and put on your best performance tonight. Do not give Manfred anything he can use against us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mandragora"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I want the ten best fighters to come with me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mandragora"
    },
    {
        "text": "As for you, I want you to tail Manfred... You saw where he was heading, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mandragora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_233_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, Captain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_233_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mandragora"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tonight, I'll rescue our 'spy.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mandragora"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've stayed here in Londinium for so long, I have to at least get one thing done before I can go home with my mind at ease, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mandragora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_233_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I won't let our leader down again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mandragora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
