        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_422_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Horn, you're back!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#2$1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I am. Where's Robben?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_422_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The team got back a while ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good. Did they find any medicine? Let me check on Salley.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_422_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's... There's no need.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you talking about?! Do you mean Salley...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "I still have to see him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Victoria has lost another fine soldier."
    },
    {
        "text": "A little girl has lost her father."
    },
    {
        "text": "How many more must we lose before we finally see the end of this tragedy?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "What was Salley's girl's name again? Was it Erin? Elisa? If memory serves, his family lived in County Ascarat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "Blake, pack up his belongings, please. Once the war is over, we'll pay his family a visit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_422_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But... he didn't leave anything behind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_422_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Nothing at all?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, Blake... At the very least, he left a story. We have to go on this journey still. His daughter will want to hear his story.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will tell her that, even in our darkest hour, her father never gave in to suffering.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_422_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Right. I'll come with you, Horn. Once the war is over.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "Also, I have a message for you. From Salley.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_422_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What... did he say?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_422_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "He said\u2014'Sorry, Lieutenant, but you must live on.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_422_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "He apologized to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_422_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "He did. And, I understood him. We all did.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "As soldiers, we all considered that we could die out there somewhere, one day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "But after we saw all that, Salley... No, all of us understood what's far scarier.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take a look at the state of Londinium. It's our home, but it's become a prison.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is dying an honorable death too much to ask for?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_422_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It shouldn't be.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_422_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Indeed, but that's the truth now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "We all know that well, but... we... we want you to keep marching down this road, because you gave us hope.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "Horn... You didn't have to carry all our hopes on your back. It's too much for one person.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_422_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's harder... to live, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ha... Looks like I owe her an apology.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_422_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Who's 'her?'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_422_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "A fine Victorian soldier, just like the rest of you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "She... Let's not talk about this now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tell everyone we don't have time to mourn.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_422_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you find out where they're keeping our people?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_422_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "There's a high chance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "If the information I got turns out to be correct, the Sarkaz will move them tomorrow morning.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I was going to ask what you think.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_422_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't have to ask. Just give us the order!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Very well, then. We will begin as soon as the sun sets.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "27_g6_hideout",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$ponder_intro",
        "key": "$ponder_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_401_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've marked the most probable locations on the map. Any thoughts?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_401_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "There are... eight spots?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even with our operators, it'll be hard to check all these places in two days.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_401_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Unfortunately, all eight fulfill the requirements of a temporary prison.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "text": "There are no settlements near any of them, which means that it's difficult for news to get in and out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're all located near the highway that leads to Central Londinium, which facilitates the Sarkaz fighters' movement around the city.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "text": "And... none of them are connected to the plate we are in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_401_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Did the Sarkaz commander figure out you're operating underground?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_401_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "He's a smart man. We mustn't underestimate him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_401_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Then... If this is where they're keeping prisoners, shouldn't there be a massive security detail guarding the place?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_401_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We thought about that too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Unfortunately, even though our recon team managed to track the Sarkaz's movement in each plate, they haven't found any openings.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "What is this place?",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_401_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "An abandoned factory. They say it used to make candy... And don't get the wrong idea. That is just what the civilians in the industrial districts usually call it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "text": "What they actually refined is an organic compound called Loxic Kohl. It's packaged like sweets for children, so everyone's come to call it 'candy'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "A candy factory? Sounds familiar...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Make this our top priority in the search.;I think we're pretty close to the answer.",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_401_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. {@nickname}, may I know why?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "We may know who owns it.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, of course. You mean Mr. Thomas?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Thomas has been working with the Sarkaz, right? He said he saw the Sarkaz using his factory for some shady business, and he was almost silenced because of it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not to mention... he has some information that Dublinn wanted too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "All the factions opposing the Sarkaz want it...;It's something the Sarkaz don't want anyone to know.",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_401_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_401_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tell Feist that this factory is our prime objective.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_401_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Harmo, keep working on the move. We will keep that option open to us too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_398_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Commander!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Self-Salvation Corps Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_401_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What is it, Lawrence?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_398_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The recon team is back. They ran into some Sarkaz mercenaries aboveground.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Self-Salvation Corps Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_401_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Casualties...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_398_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Four injured, and one... captured.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Self-Salvation Corps Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_401_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry everyone, the meeting ends here. I need to take a look.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#10$1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Commander...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_398_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Rockrock, what are you doing? We just got your wounds bandaged!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Self-Salvation Corps Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No... I have something I must tell the commander.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_401_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_4040_rockr_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you find her...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_401_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_4040_rockr_1#10$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, we got news from Lady Golding. She's still at the school in the northern residential district, and she's safe...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "But they were ambushed by the Sarkaz during a social gathering two days ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "And the Messenger lady... was taken prisoner.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_401_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_4040_rockr_1#10$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait a moment, please\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is the Messenger you are referring to the one who requested you to rendezvous with Rhodes Island?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "The lady who helped us get into Victoria.;She gathered lots of information on Victoria.;Kal'tsit's old friend.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_401_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right... That's her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, Dr.{@nickname}, our rescue operation has been moved up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_401_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's very important to the Self-Salvation Corps. She holds a lot of information, and this might even affect our evacuation operation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, I understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's irreplaceable to Rhodes Island too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "This will be our first joint operation.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_401_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good. I have faith that Rhodes Island will help us rescue our imprisoned Messenger from the Sarkaz\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_401_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our strongest warrior, our most important ally, and our most trusted friend, Lady Heidi Thomson.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
